00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.300
Second question.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.150
Bear with me, guys.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:38.650
Come on.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.067
You guys don't seem really
